# Axon 911 Workspace

The workspace rule lives in `docs/workspace-rule.md` in this repository. Read it
before reviewing or editing anything. It is the single source for both hosts:
Cursor loads it through this file, and the `a911-harness` Claude Code plugin
injects the same document at `SessionStart`.

Do not restate roots, source priority, verification commands, or safety rules
here. Two copies drift, and the drift is invisible until a review cites the
stale one.

## Resolve the harness root

Locate this repository by finding both of:

- `docs/review-contract.md`
- `docs/workspace-rule.md`

Do not assume the current shell directory is any particular root.
